  "description": "ASP.NET Core endpoints (like scrapyd) for the Scrapy.Net platform: manage spiders and declarative scraping rules, run/stop/pause/resume/cancel/retry jobs, cron schedules, live dashboard, alerts and outgoing webhooks, with API-key authentication and Admin/Operator/Viewer roles, plus the Scrapy.Net Console: a browser admin UI (dashboard, spiders, jobs, schedules, selector builder, alerts). Dibuat oleh Gravicode Studios, dipimpin oleh Kang Fadhil.",
